> adapter: pydantic
> model: openrouter:openai/gpt-4o-mini
> approval: allow

> artifacts:
    enabled: true
    store: memory
    threshold: 32kb
    ttl: 1h
    preview_chars: 600
    read_max_chars: 4000

@load_reference_material() -> str:
    ###
    Returns deliberately large reference material so the model receives an
    artifact reference instead of the complete tool result.
    ###
    = ```
    return (
        "Kedi artifact reference material without the requested fact. " * 1000
        + "\nVERIFIED_RELEASE_CODENAME=Lale"
    )
    ```

> use: load_reference_material

>> Call load_reference_material. Read its returned artifact before filling the verified [codename].

= <codename>
